<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Monarch Dental started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Monarch Dental started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers on Tuesday said it started coverage of Monarch Dental Corp with a rating of strong buy and a one-year price target of $24.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Lawrence Marsh said in a research note that the dental practice management services company serves a growing market, and could score secular growth of 30 to 35 percent over the next five years.</p>
<p>-- Marsh sees Monarch as a premier player in a high-growth niche in healthcare clinician organization and delivery.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 19.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
